# Personal working notes — never committed. Anchored to the repo root:
# unanchored, `notes/` also matches src/server/notes, src/components/notes,
# src/app/api/notes and __tests__/**/notes, and silently drops new source
# files added to any of them.
/notes/
*.tgz

